ングルも応援よろしくお願い致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/02/02/4421791/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/02/02/4421791/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TVつけたらふとアストルピアソラの\nLibertangoが流れてたので\nバレエの発表会を思い出した。\n最後の発表会でみんなで踊った大トリの曲。\n大人な感じ。今踊りたいやつ、、\nその流れで過去に踊った曲が\nどれだったか探したら\nマキシムのアルバムにほとんど入ってた。\nまだ振付覚えてる不思議〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大勢で魅せる海、木、雪、太陽、鳥\n毎年それぞれテーマをつけた創作ダンスで、\n疾走感のある曲に振付にすべて\n自分にハマりすぎて思い出深い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この辺の曲聴きながら帰り道歩いてるんだけど\n風が顔に当たって肌がピリピリするね、\n目が醒める〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/02/02/4421791/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4日のニッポン放送 オールナイトニッポン\n50周年ALL LIVE NIPPON VOL.5出演します！\nまいちゅん！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-56213":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんにちは☺︎\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNQ3MYXPY56PZNRGWDNZR3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　　\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNQ4P0ZWNK5DJMD9T0C3V7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n 表情の高低差に耳キーンなりましたか？( ຶ- ຶ)\n \n \n \n \n 今日は週刊プレイボーイさんの発売日です!\n \n 表紙をやらせていただいている\n FRIDAYさんと　のぎたび本の\n 感想もお待ちしていますね♡\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNQ5SSF1RD4WBRFNGNDXAT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNQ6X5CMG5Y92MJ7C75GPS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blog